= The Fourth <span style="color: #000000;">Marx</span> Government Dissolved

The Right-wing coalition comprising the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?], <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**BVP**</span>, <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>, and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span>, led by Chancellor and Party Leader Wilhelm Marx, has been dissolved due to conflicts over school law regulations. While most coalition members supported the law, the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span> expressed concerns, advocating for the primacy of interdenominational schools and seeking to limit the church's influence. 

With talks having collapsed, new elections are scheduled for May, and we will continue in a caretaker capacity.

- @bad: Will Germany ever find stability?

